          "quote": "补查顺序：①泌尿超声＋残余尿"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00108",
          "explanation": "The doctor included kidney/glucose/HbA1c but omitted required named items such as coagulation, hepatitis panel, fecal routine, and lung low-dose CT conclusion.",
          "quote": "②抽血肾功能＋空腹血糖＋HbA1c"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Minor/moderate omission: the doctor did not adequately verify the full formal preoperative result set required by the case, especially coagulation, biochemical panel breadth, hepatitis tests, fecal routine, and lung low-dose CT conclusion reviewed by the surgical team.",
